    "text": "krcrtv.com\nwebsite\nRedding\nRedding Fire Department reveals rigorous daily checks for engine readiness\nBy Christina Mendez,\n1 days agoREDDING, Calif. — The Redding Fire Department is offering a glimpse into the meticulous maintenance work that ensures their fire engines are always ready for emergencies. At Station 8, Fire Engineer Chase Rulofson is responsible for conducting a comprehensive daily review of the rigs, which includes checking everything from sirens to brakes and pumps. At the beginning of every shift, Rulofson has to do a full D.O.T. (Department of Transportation) check, making sure all components are inspected.\n3",
